# Git remote helper for push-disabled:// URLs. The entrypoint rewrites every push to a network remote to this scheme
# (url.push-disabled://.pushInsteadOf), so a push from the box fails here with a message that says why.

printf 'error: pushing is disabled in the review box; hand the result back as a patch (review-workspace patch)\n' >&2
exit 1
